roro sakina kehti thi amma neend nahi aati<br>
yaad aati hain baba ki amma neend nahi aati<br>
<br>
1. shaam-e-ghareeba aayi hain dard ke manzar layi hai<br>
kaisi qayamat chahi hain charo taraf tanhaai hai<br>
ek-ek lamha hai bhari amma neend nahi aati<br>
<br>
2. aag hai kurte mein amma kano se hain khoon rawan<br>
chaya hai ankhon mein dhuwa bolo mere aamu hain kaha<br>
mere gale mein hain rassi amma neend nahi aati<br>
<br>
3. jab bhi tamache khati hoon dard se chakra jati hoon<br>
khauf se main ghabrati hoon sonch ke yeh tharrati hoon<br>
duniya meri barbaad huwi amma neend nahi aati<br>
<br>
4. chod gaye humko baba maare gaye hain mere chacha<br>
kaun chudane ayega dum ghutta hai ab mera<br>
dil pa mere chalti hain churi amma neend nahi aati<br>
<br>
5. mujh se qismat ruthi hai zindan mein khamoshi hai<br>
yeh kaisi tareeki hai har dum rokar kehti hai<br>
din nikla ya raat huwi amma neend nahi aati<br>
<br>
6. baba ko jab paungi gaal apne dikhlaon gi<br>
haal apna batlaungi seeney par sojaongi<br>
neend hai mujh se roothi amma neend nahi aati<br>
<br>
7. mujhko tamache hain mare gaal hai mere sujhe huwe<br>
kaan mere zakhmi karke cheene gaye mere bundhe<br>
roz jafa hoti hain nayi amma neend nahi aati<br>
<br>
8. qaid mein kabtak rehna hain dukh ye kab tak sehna hai<br>
dur watan mein behna hain kis se gham yeh kehna hai<br>
hogi rehaai kab meri amma neend nahi aati<br>
<br>
9. har lamha hain ranjo mehan sujha huwa hain mera dahan<br>
zakhmi hain ab mera badan zinda mein hoti hain ghutan<br>
koun sune rudaad meri amma neend nahi aati<br>
<br>
10. baba mere ab ayenge zindaan se chudwayenge<br>
seene se liptayenge hum apne ghar jayenge<br>
sonchti rehti hoon mein yahi amma neend nahi aati<br>
<br>
11. zakhmi lasha qasim ka akber ka zakhmi seena<br>
khoonme bhara wo mashkiza baba ka besar lasha<br>
manzar hai ankhon mein sabhi amma neend nahi aati<br>
<br>
12. pyass ka hai mujh par yeh asar dhundhla gayi hai meri nazar<br>
saans bhi lagti hai nishtar phat-ta hai sadme se jigar<br>
hoti hai takleef badi amma neend nahi atti<br>
<br>
13. baap ke sar se lipti huwi bain jo karti thi bachi<br>
ahle haram rote the sabhi maut ki jab ayyi hichki<br>
shikwe the hotoun pe yahi amma neend nahi aati<br>
<br>
14. kaise likhe razvi-o-nazar dil pe chale kitne khanjar<br>
kaise sunti thi maadar bali sakina jab rokar<br>
indaan mein kehti thi yahi amma neend nahi aati